prompt:
Add common command aliases to improve CLI usability. Update the following Cobra command definitions in src/main.go to include additional aliases:

- newCmd: add Aliases: []string{"add", "create"}
- acceptCmd: add Aliases: []string{"merge"}
- deleteCmd: update existing Aliases to []string{"rm", "remove"}
- inspectCmd: add Aliases: []string{"shell"}
- describeCmd: add Aliases: []string{"info"}
- pruneCmd: add Aliases: []string{"clean"}
- showCmd: add Aliases: []string{"diff"}

Follow the same pattern as statusCmd which already has Aliases: []string{"ls", "list"}.
